  unitName: Goddess Emilia
  unitId: 40124
  unitNumber: 164
  description: A dual-wielding general mentioned in the records of the ruined Atharva
    Republic. She fought on the front lines, even during the war with the gods. In
    Atharva, she reached the same level as the Commander Weiss. Rumor was that they
    were lovers, but she vehemently denied this when asked. She lived her short life
    single, saying, "I live for my sword, not love."
  summonDesc: Only a great warrior could<br>have the power to subdue me!<br>What
    do you plan to do with me?
  fusionDesc: How my power overflows!<br>My soul trembles with joy!!
  evoDesc: I will transcend and<br>evolve if it is asked of me.<br>Everyone should
    do the same.
  element: 4
  rarity: 4
